              "instruction": "dhandhāmā̃ khoṭ gaī ane vepārīnũ devāḷũ nīkaḷyũ. — The business made a loss and the merchant went bankrupt.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *dhandhāmā̃ khoṭ gaī ane vepārīnũ devāḷũ nīkaḷyũ.* — The business made a loss and the merchant went bankrupt.]"
